        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Sipra Laddha",
        "text_sha256": "7c02edee188699b3753bce68048ee66f932d4deb66880fc017b560f8cb1a338a",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h1",
        "text": "Sipra Laddha, M.D.",
        "text_sha256": "69508db317660e2aa8bf5e619542b50d735af59d8e2f70f8c2cc687b674195fa",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "About Sipra Laddha, M.D.",
        "text_sha256": "38a4867aec0240412d771ff84319c27756918646f45cb6871a48a0dcd433fb4c",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Sipra Laddha, M.D., is a board-certified physician and psychiatrist in the Atlanta, Georgia, area who is trained in psychopharmacology, psychodynamic psychotherapy, cognitive behavioral therapy (CBT), and humanistic psychotherapy. Dr. Laddha specializes in perinatal psychiatry and women's mental health. She got her medical degree from the University at Buffalo School of Medicine.",
        "text_sha256": "ae31ef4a7659c4d52871a64a7d7c54aa8e0b4538b831e7de330ce060871da15a",
        "word_count": 51
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Dr. Laddha co-founded LunaJoy Health , focused on holistic women's mental health services, where she is working to rapidly increase awareness and access around common (but rarely addressed) mental health struggles during vulnerable life transitions.",
        "text_sha256": "5ba9aef29371a9bff9c5cfd2134c9b7361a33de255d61964c6cc9ee6f351910a",
        "word_count": 35
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Board certifications",
        "text_sha256": "b6ebfd0050d34a00e27b7a07eb958e6520d9d8c003bea281b96762ad17883d6b",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Dr. Laddha is board-certified by the American Board of Psychiatry and Neurology.",
        "text_sha256": "abba0d41fc9e5582c3941cbf91d6541a35de99313af25610bbdd8c16ddb93cfd",
        "word_count": 12
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Hospital affiliations",
        "text_sha256": "e6504e68d7e8e6b8187bc1b13e33b31f751fb7b365b27cf9f90691053f642ba2",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Dr. Laddha is affiliated with Atlanta Veterans Affairs Medical Center in Decatur, Georgia.",
        "text_sha256": "38a23fe393b5b8d5a52c33aa77ab65d0d57bf9080130aa3f86985db89ef603e0",
        "word_count": 13
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Other relevant positions",
        "text_sha256": "3cb35bf4b505f1c9652a309bbf062b6c5ebff2ba01239bd968b9ac137f401f2b",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Dr. Laddha trained at the Emory University School of Medicine residency program in Atlanta, and served as chief resident there.",
        "text_sha256": "fe5b467732c9dbf91823020bebfb747cf98ab9966133007dd9d53bf4940fec2a",
        "word_count": 20
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000011",
        "block_index": 11,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "She is the mom of four children, including a set of twins, who have been her biggest motivators and teachers.",
        "text_sha256": "daaed277a951ecc38463e805f5ec2a3f27ef3de010ca71c26c652cd0dc85c434",
        "word_count": 20
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000012",
        "block_index": 12,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The educational health content on What To Expect is reviewed by our medical review board and team of experts to be up-to-date and in line with the latest evidence-based medical information and accepted health guidelines, including the medically reviewed What to Expect books by Heidi Murkoff. This educational content is not medical or diagnostic advice. Use of this site is subject to our terms of use and privacy policy . © 2005-2026 Everyday Health, Inc., a Ziff Davis company.",
        "text_sha256": "c423e7e136e9c8ebf39e668c5b1617d92d49cbd07ce74c8b1ec308c597fa3593",
        "word_count": 79
      },
      {
